{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>They shall howl.</b> The tav ought to have a patach beneath it, after the pattern of יישירו נגדך (Proverbs 4:25), and similarly ממרחק יידע (Psalms 138:9 and 6), and אלמנה לא ייטיב (Job 24:21)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 65, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:02.417379355Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}